The canonical coding conventions for this repo live in `docs/agent/coding-conventions.md`.

Read that file first — it is the single source of truth for stack, style, and backend route-handler rules. This repo is a Next.js 16 full-stack app in `web/` (Postgres + Supabase auth + Cloudflare Workers) using HeroUI v3 (not Shadcn/Radix). Legacy Vite frontend and Java backend are archived under `_archive-coffeemode-frontend/` and `_archive-coffeemode-backend/`.

For orientation, follow `docs/agent/reading-order.md`, `docs/STRUCTURE.md`, and `AGENTS.md`.
